==Battleground==
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Takuya (Enemy)|Takuya]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**10 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

